abstract: >
  CDSA-MRO is the reference implementation of the maintenance safety
  pillar of the Complementary Diagnostic Safety Approach (CDSA). It
  contains the synthetic incident data and record schema, NumPy reference
  implementations of the federated reinforcement learning modules
  (v2.2.0), the Faz E preregistered evaluation code and run records, the
  E15 typology coverage audit and the frozen coding book (v2.3.0).
  Release v2.4.0 adds the transition-dependence test and the 18 October
  2026 validation diagnostic study. All data are synthetic or public.
